OL,3,GNEWSASix arrests after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix more people have been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a police officer was shot in
OL,8,FNottingham city centre.
OL,10,FPC Lee Lane was shot in the foot after
OL,11,Fapproaching two suspects at a bus stop
OL,12,Fin Angel Row, shortly before 04:50 BST
OL,13,Fon 18 October.
OL,15,FHe remains in hospital receiving
OL,16,Ftreatment, Nottinghamshire Police said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
