OL,3,GNEWSASix arrests after police officer
OL,4,Ainjured in shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man was arrested in the
OL,7,FScunthorpe area on Tuesday, on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of possession of a firearm to
OL,9,Fendanger life and grievous bodily harm.
OL,10,FFive others - two men, 24 and 31, and
OL,11,Fthree women, 21, 38 and 38 - were
OL,12,Farrested on the same day on suspicion
OL,13,Fof assisting an offender.
